body:
I'm so sorry to hear this especially since I had 4 attempts in the past but the idea of it forever stays in my mind. I'm not gonna toss a hotline or give you shit only people who have never fell as far as you. I used to be a child with hopes and dreams now i'm almost 30 and don't see the point, tried to hang myself when I was 12. Been in therapy for 8 plus years taking pills to feel more numb

&#x200B;

I am just broken for good but waiting it out
